binnacle copies these files from pi (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi), from pi-tui in packages/tui unless a line says otherwise, at commit d86654abb8862e201933517d6f1fce9f88dd117f (v0.99.1), under its MIT licence:

- src/terminal/pi/utils.ts, from packages/tui/src/utils.ts
- src/terminal/pi/stdin-buffer.ts, from packages/tui/src/stdin-buffer.ts
- src/terminal/pi/keys.ts, from packages/tui/src/keys.ts
- src/terminal/pi/keybindings.ts, from packages/tui/src/keybindings.ts
- src/terminal/pi/kill-ring.ts, from packages/tui/src/kill-ring.ts
- src/terminal/pi/undo-stack.ts, from packages/tui/src/undo-stack.ts
- src/terminal/pi/word-navigation.ts, from packages/tui/src/word-navigation.ts
- src/terminal/pi/components/editor.ts, from packages/tui/src/components/editor.ts
- src/terminal/pi/components/input.ts, from packages/tui/src/components/input.ts
- src/terminal/pi/components/select-list.ts, from packages/tui/src/components/select-list.ts
- src/terminal/pi/autocomplete.ts, the types of packages/tui/src/autocomplete.ts that the editor names
- src/terminal/pi/tui.ts, the types and the cursor marker of packages/tui/src/tui.ts that the editor names
- src/terminal/pi/colors.ts, what the theme takes of packages/tui/src/colors.ts to draw a colour
- src/terminal/pi/dark.json, from packages/coding-agent/src/modes/interactive/theme/dark.json, pi's own dark theme
- src/terminal/pi/light.json, from packages/coding-agent/src/modes/interactive/theme/light.json, pi's own light theme
- src/terminal/pi/oklab.ts, what colors.ts takes of packages/tui/src/oklab.ts, which ports Björn Ottosson's Oklab and OKHSL under the MIT licence, as its header says

